{
  "26beachgame.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_beachlife.png",
  "26beachgame.text": "Summer vacation is here! Enjoy sunny days, sandy beaches, and Mediterranean vibes.\\n\\nh2. How to play:\\n\\nIf you have already played the previous versions, ‘Farm in Colours’ and ‘Winter in Colours’, the game is based on the same principle.\\n\\n- Your goal is to recreate 7 different wild animal images in the badge display.\\n- Take the different teleports leading to each game area.\\n- Once you’ve collected all 7 badges, return to the Hall and sit on one of the chairs, to receive a bonus prize.\\n\\nIf you’ve missed any badges, a message will let you know which ones you’re missing.\\n\\nPS : if you are stuck somewhere, say: **exit**\\n\\nGood luck!",
  "26beachgame.title": "Summer in Colors!",
