  "jul26templex.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_jul26junglex.png",
  "jul26templex.text": "Complete quests and escape the labyrinth by finding the Key and the Exit, but watch out for the boulders! Getting hit loses you a life, and after three lives off you go. \\n \\nThe labyrinth shifts each time you re-enter, so be ready to orient yourself again! \\n\\nh1. Instructions:\\n\\n- Click on the rolling boulder to play. If game rooms are full, you are placed in a queue.\\n- Say * to mark or unmark the position you are in \\n- There is a time limit of 20 minutes. Don't worry, your quests will remain active!\\n\\nThe game is open until Sunday 2 August, be sure to finish everything by then.",
